10. World-State Loom

Combines information from different media into one inspectable state.

Web research
+ repository history
+ documents
+ spreadsheets
+ images
+ conversations
+ schedules
+ live interfaces
────────────────────
typed world state

It labels every element as:

fact
observation
reported claim
inference
prediction
metaphor
decision
constraint
unknown

This keeps the game imaginative without letting imagination silently overwrite the board.

